{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12668","headline":"引极三首 望仙府 · 元结","name":"引极三首 望仙府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山凿落兮眇嶔岑，云溶溶兮木棽棽。\n中何有兮人不覩，远欹差兮閟仙府。\n彼仙府兮深且幽，望一至兮藐无由。\n望不从兮知如何，心混混兮意浑和。\n思假足兮虎豹，超阻绝兮凌趠。\n诣仙府兮从羽人，饵五灵兮保清真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}